          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_21_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "\\frac{10}{1000} = \\frac{10}{1000} \\;  kg  = \\frac{1}{100} \\;  kg  = 0.010 \\;  kg ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
